76
00:06:11.479 --> 00:06:18.434
(narrator) Then the tangle disappears: a PaymentGateway credential badge with charge and refund sits between the services and the provider.

77
00:06:18.434 --> 00:06:25.389
(narrator) A suave secret agent in a dinner jacket and bow tie, martini in hand, appears in a spotlight and says: Gateway, Payment Gateway.

78
00:06:25.389 --> 00:06:28.051
(narrator) Agent Payment Gateway's secret is which provider.

79
00:06:28.051 --> 00:06:31.257
(narrator) Only a PayPalGateway file below it holds the PayPal secret.

80
00:06:31.257 --> 00:06:35.278
(narrator) A StripeGateway plugs in beside it, and all three services stay unchanged.

81
00:06:35.887 --> 00:06:39.427
♪ Your team builds a store: checkout, refunds, a wallet. ♪

82
